### TH Terminal API — open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request"
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Server + data feed status
GET {{base}}/status

### All stocks with toolkit readings
GET {{base}}/stocks

### One stock with daily bars and the HCI series
GET {{base}}/stocks/NVDA

### Screener: HCI too low AND in a buyer zone
GET {{base}}/screener?signals=os,bz

### Screener: AI stocks with negative HCI, sorted by HCI ascending
GET {{base}}/screener?group=AI&hciMax=0&sort=hci&dir=asc

### Signal ids you can use in the screener
GET {{base}}/signals

### ---------------- Crypto ----------------
### All coins with toolkit readings + derivatives
GET {{base}}/crypto/coins

### One coin
GET {{base}}/crypto/coins/BTC

### Coins with negative funding and HCI below zero
GET {{base}}/crypto/screener?hciMax=0&sort=hci&dir=asc

### Derivatives for every coin
GET {{base}}/crypto/derivatives

### Whale trades of $1M or more
GET {{base}}/crypto/whales?kind=trade&minUsd=1000000

### Global market, Fear & Greed, DeFi, stablecoins, DEX, trending
GET {{base}}/crypto/research
